xtRef="C_6e566871-a873-4f86-bd54-5868bb91c9a2" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">2.4</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> of operating outflows from operating leases. During the year ended December 31, 2024 and 2023</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">, the Company recognized approximately $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_f30a9720-58de-4d72-8cf2-f76cde0570f2" contextRef="C_f5bccc35-6cdf-46e5-920a-d24d4821de97" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5">1.6</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million and $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><ix:nonFraction id="F_ef522861-f206-4bda-964c-ade8164b8650" contextRef="C_1fd10cbb-f699-4ae2-9100-9481c24e88e9" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseExpense" unitRef="U_USD" scale="6" decimals="-5">1.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> million of lease costs in operating expenses, respectively. The total operating outflows from operating leases was approximately $</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"><